---
import Marketing from '../layouts/Marketing.astro';
import { t } from '../i18n/site';
---

<Marketing path="/privacy/" title={t.privacy.title}>
  <article class="np-container np-prose">
    <h1 class="np-h1">{t.privacy.title}</h1>
    <p class="np-muted">{t.privacy.updated}</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      NovaProse is an independent open-source project. The novaprose.com website and the NovaProse Cloud
      waitlist are run by the project’s founder as a private individual (the data controller). For any
      question about your data, write to <a href="mailto:hello@novaprose.com">hello@novaprose.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Cloud waitlist.</strong> Your email, role, team size, site language, the time you joined
      and the version of the consent text. We don’t store your IP address: it is only kept in server memory to limit how many
      sign-ups come from one address.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Collaboration demo.</strong> Text, comments and the name you enter in the demo are visible to
      other people in the same room. Demo rooms are not saved: they are removed from server memory when the
      last person leaves.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Browser settings.</strong> Your theme and demo name are kept in your browser’s localStorage
      and are not sent to us.
    </p>
    <p>We don’t use advertising or analytics cookies and don’t load third-party trackers.</p>

    <h2>Why and on what basis</h2>
    <p>
      We use the waitlist email only to tell you about NovaProse Cloud early access and its terms. The
      legal basis is your consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)). We don’t sell your data or share it with third
      parties for their own purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
    <p>
      Waitlist entries are stored on our server in Helsinki (Finland, EU), hosted by Hetzner. The website
      is delivered through Cloudflare, which processes technical request data (such as IP addresses) to
      deliver and protect the site.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      While the waitlist is open and for no longer than 12 months after Cloud launches, or until you ask
      us to delete it or withdraw your consent.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask for a copy of your data, correct or delete it, and withdraw your consent at any time:
      write to <a href="mailto:hello@novaprose.com">hello@novaprose.com</a> from the email you signed up
      with. You may also complain to the data protection authority in your country.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page and the date above.</p>
  </article>
</Marketing>
